<title>UK: Fedex tops Newark 1996 cargo carriers.</title>
<headline>Fedex tops Newark 1996 cargo carriers.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The top three air cargo carriers at Newark International in 1996 were Federal Express Corp, United Parcel Service of America and Continental Airlines, the Port Authority of New York and New Jersey said.</p>
<p>It said 1995 data were unavailable.</p>
<p>Top 10 Newark Cargo Carriers in 1996 (in tonnes)</p>
<p> FedEX			   466,739</p>
<p> United Parcel Service     140,049</p>
<p> Continental Airlines	 64,246</p>
<p> Airborne.Express...........27,335</p>
<p> United.Airlines............25,064</p>
<p> SAS........................24,674</p>
<p> Amer.Int.Air-Kalitta.......23,912</p>
<p> Emery Worldwide............17,028</p>
<p> Mountain Air Cargo.........12,591</p>
<p> American. Airlines.........12,567</p>
<p>-Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542-7706 Fax+5017</p>
